<%- include('partials/header', { pageTitle: 'About', currentPage: 'about' }) %>

<section class="container single-page">
  <div class="content-box">
    <span class="badge">Overview</span>
    <h1>About this project</h1>
    <p>
      This assessment project was redesigned into a modern Express application to showcase
      JavaScript event handling in a browser-friendly structure.
    </p>
    <p>
      The original logic revolved around EventEmitter, bubbling events, and event-loop behavior.
      Now the same ideas are presented through structured web pages using routes and EJS templates.
    </p>

    <div class="info-list">
      <div>
        <h3>Goals</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Make the project readable in the browser</li>
          <li>Display each assessment question as a route</li>
          <li>Apply modern styling and layout</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Technologies</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Node.js</li>
          <li>Express.js</li>
          <li>EJS</li>
          <li>CSS</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
